<scopecontent encodinganalog="520$a">
<head>Scope and Content
</head>
<p>This collection consists of correspondence to Evelina Magruder congratulating her on publication of the first alumnae bulletin, typed annual reports for the years 1964-1966, and notes for the alumnae office functions, bulletins, and chapters.
</p>
